-- title:
--   Integrality of j(qᵖ)j(q)⁻ᵖ and its congruence to 1 mod p
-- statement:
--   Let $p$ be a prime and $M$ a nonzero natural number, let $H$ be a subgroup of $(\mathbb{Z}/M)^\times$, assume $p \mid M$, and assume the hypothesis `hj` that the Laurent series `jqModC ℚ` — namely $q^{-1}$ times the rational $q$-series of $E_4^3 \cdot \eta^{-24}$, i.e. the $q$-expansion of $j$ — lies in the $q$-expansion function field `qExpFunctionFieldC ℚ ⊤` of full level, the subfield of $\mathbb{Q}((q))$ generated over $\mathbb{Q}$ by the ratios of integral $q$-expansions of modular forms of equal weight. The assertion is the existence of an element $t$ of `chartAlgInf p (ΓM M H) hj`, the subalgebra of $\infty$-chart functions in `qExpFunctionFieldC ℚ (ΓM M H)` consisting of those elements integral over the `R p`-subalgebra generated by the inverse of the distinguished element `jAt (ΓM M H) hj`, together with Laurent series $y, z$ with coefficients in `R p`, such that: the Laurent series in $\mathbb{Q}((q))$ underlying $t$ equals `qExpand ℚ p (jqModC ℚ)` (the substitution $q \mapsto q^p$ applied to the $q$-expansion of $j$) times the $p$-th power of the inverse of `jqModC ℚ`; applying the coefficientwise map induced by the algebra map `R p → ℚ` to $y$ gives that same Laurent series; and $y = 1 + p \cdot z$.
--
--   This is the function-field input for the cusp chart on the $\infty$-component of the two-chart integral model of the modular curve of level $\Gamma_H(M)$ at $p$: the Atkin–Lehner-type function $j(q^p)j(q)^{-p}$ is a pole-chart function whose $q$-expansion admits an `R p`-integral lift congruent to $1$ modulo $p$, which is the Kronecker congruence $j(q)^p \equiv j(q^p)$ in integral form. It is used by the results in [`ModularCurve.XHDRModelAtP`](def/ModularCurve_XHDRModelAtP.html#L81) describing the cusp charts and the étale behaviour along the $\infty$-side of the model.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_XHDRLevel_exists_chartAlgInf_coe_eq_qExpand_jqModC_mul_inv_pow_and_coeffMap_eq_one_add.lean

